{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026iEY1W1v7ND1795598127.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>《女神配對計劃2》自開播以來話題不斷，當中現年26歲的中葡芬混血參賽者方智弘（Oscar），憑藉陽光俊朗的外貌，以及在節目中細心體貼的表現，成功吸納大批支持者。近日，有網民在乘搭港鐵期間巧遇Oscar，更發文大讚他私下同樣極具愛心，暖心舉動獲網民一致好評。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"8feee6f9-ec41-4fda-9449-814fee717e14.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026kC8h6GaZ3y1795598126.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>該名網民於社交平台上載一張港鐵車廂內的現場照片，並留言分享：「偶遇女神配對計劃2的Oscar！ 佢好好啊，扶阿婆行去慢慢坐低。」見方智弘當日打扮休閒低調，在車廂內主動攙扶同車長者慢慢就座。不少網民看過帖文後紛紛留言大讚他「人帥心善」、「鏡頭前後都咁細心有禮貌」，直指其善良體貼的舉動十分加分。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"cd4cea07-21b3-454d-9f6b-1177fd78b5be.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026S0lan8w1LY1795598125.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T10:43:56.596284+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":275,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T09:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T03:53:26.495851+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T10:37:18.597585+00:00","content_hash":"58eb15fa8bb8b7ffc8511885eb95d0c2889c620b0f2189b84ef0d412b23caa53","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T10:43:56.596284+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}